<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thessalonicate</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thessalonicate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silas le Timothy in — Ih Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ neisa Thessalonica pawlpi mite tungah lai kong thaak uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ in note tungah thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suapuite awng, note atu in hun theampo ah Pathian ka pok uh kul hi. Tuabang ka ngamtat tu uh sia maan hi, banghang ziam cile na upna uh nasia khan mama a, tuaciang note khat sim ii midangte na itna uh lian vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ii pawlpite sungah no huvau ka kisuantaakna uh sia in hi thu hang ahi hi. Vawtsiatna le ngimna teng theampo na thuak uh kawm panin, thuak zawkna le upna na nei tan uh hu in a kisuangtaak ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu a na thuakna teng in Pathian thukhen na sia thumaan a hina kilanghsak hi, tua in noma ii na ngimlaw uh ama Kumpi Ngam taw a kilawm hong suaksak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in a maan bangin seam tu hi: note hong thuaksakte tungah thuakna tungsak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang no a thuakte le ko zongh nopsakna hong pia tu hi. Topa Jesus in ama ii a thahat vantunglalangte taw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian a nialte le Topa Jesus Lungdamna Thupha a zui nuam ngawlte daan pia tu in meikuang taw hong pai ciang ama in tuasia seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ii mihing theampo le a thu um mihingte tung pan minthanna le vaang piakna a nga tu in, tua Ni Topa hong pai ciang, Topa mai le vaanglet minthan na pan amate kikhen tu a, tawntung lalcipna daan thuak tu hi. Note zongh, ko ii kong son thute um zo na hi uh ciangin tua thu um te sungah na kihel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note atu in a tawntungin thu kong ngetsakna in hi thu hang ahi hi. A nungta tu in ama hong sap na nuntakna sungah a kiphu a kilawm hong suasak natu in, Pathian munah kong ngetsak uh hi. Ama in a vaangletna taw phat natu na deina theampo khuangkhimsak tahen a, upna taw nasepna hong taangtungsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bangin ih Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna taw ih Topa Jesus min in, note tung pan minthanna saang tu a, note zongh in ama tung pan minthanna na saang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ hong pai kik natu le ama taw omkhawm tu in, ih kikhoptuana thu taw kizomin: suapuite awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa hong pai tu Ni sia hong tung zo hi ci in a kison thu taw na khua ngaisutna uh nawngkaisak heak vun a, na thin kiamsak memeang heak vun ci in kong thuum uh hi. Hi thu sia kote kamsaanna sung, ahibuale thuhilna sung, tua ahibuale laithak atna sungah kote in son hi ci in kingaisun hi thei tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangbang po ahizong kuama in na theamsak heak vun. Banghang ziam cile a khakbel Kileedona, hong om a, hell sung a theng tu in a kisep sa A Seksolpa hong kilangh mateng in tua Ni sia hong tung ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in pathian a kici theampo ahibuale biak thei theampo langpan tu a, tuate tungsia ah ama le ama kikoi tu hi. Ama in Pathian Biakinnpi sung ngawngawn ah tum in to tu a, Pathian ka hi hi ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ciamtee ngawl nu ziam? Hite sia no taw ka omkhop lai in kong sonsiat sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahitazong, tu laitak hisia a pian ngawl natu in a khak khat om a, tuasia bang ziam na heak uh hi. Tua ahikom a hun a cin ciang A Seksolpa hong kilangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lamdang Seksolna in tu in na hong seam zo hi, ahihang a khaktanpa a kihepkeak matengin a piang tu thu sia piang ngawl lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciangin A Seksolpa sia hong kilaak tu a, ahihang Topa Jesus hong pai ciang, a kam sung pan a huu pusuak sia taw ama that tu a, a taang velvol a vaangletna taw lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Seksolpa sia Satan vaangletna taw hong pai tu a, nalamdang lakna a theam le a lamdang na nam tuatuamte hong vawt tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin a lal tu teng tungah a seksol theamna namcin zangh tu hi. Amate lal tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate a kihutna tu thumaan thutak sia a saang bua uh a, a it bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in telkhialna vaang ama te sungah puak a, amate in a maan ngawl thute a up natu in na seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikomin, tua thumaan thutak a um ngawl, mawna sungah a nuamsa theampo, kipuavawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa hong it suapuite awng, note atu in Pathian tungah a tawntungin lungdam ka ko hamtang tu uh hi. Banghang ziam cile Thaa ii vaangletna taw ama mi thiangthote hong suasak natu le thumaan thutak na upna uh taw a kingum phitbelte na sua natu uh in Pathian ii tealte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha no tungah kong hilna uh tungtawnin Pathian in hisia atu hong sam hi; Ama in ih Topa Jesus Christ minthanna tel na nga natu hong sam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom suapuite awng, thuhilna le laithakna taw kong hil uh thumaante kholet vun a, kip takin ding vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ama mama le eite hong it a, a thuthiamna taw a kiam ngeingawl thinletna le lametna kho hong pia, ih Pa Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a tawntungin a pha sep natu le pau natu hong hanthawn in hong thahat sak tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A khakbel in suapuite awng, Topa thu sia note sungah na saan bangma in, manlang takin a kizel natu le thasiana taw a kisaan thei tawntung natu in, kote atu thu hong ngetsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing seksolte le misiate khut sung pan Pathian ii hong suataksak natu in thu hong ngetsak si tavun; banghang ziam cile mihing simin tua thu um ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Topa sia thumaan a, ama in note A Ngilopa kung pan hong keamcingin hong thahatsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note kungah kong son thute na zui uh bangma in zui paisuak tatak tu ci in note muanna thin kote sungah Topa in hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian hong itna le Christ ii hong piak thuak zawkna a thukzaw in na tel thei natu Topa in lam hong pui tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suapuite awng, kong lamlak nate zui ngawl a, datham nuntakzia taw a nungta suapuite theampo kung panin na kikeam tavun ci in Topa Jesus Christ min taw thu kong pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ko ngamtat bang na ngamtat tu uh sia noma ma in na heak uh ahi hi. Note taw ka om uh lai in ko datham ngawl khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Man piak ngawlin kuama tung pan huna saang ngawl khu hi. Tua taangin naseam a, diang khu hi; note khat po atu in supna zanna ka hi ngawl natu in a sun a zanin ka seam tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi bangin ka hi uh sia, ngual ii hu tu le et tu in, a kilawm ngawl ka hi uh hang, ahi bua hi; nong ettee tu le nong zui tu in tuabangin ngamta ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No taw ih om lai in, “Na a seam nuam ngawl peuma an nesak ngawl tu hi,” kong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi bangin kong ci theina uh sia, no sungah mihing pawlkhat datham a, ngual nasepna kamkumh in, nawngkaisak tu ci simngawl sep dang nei ngawl ci in ka za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ min taw hi mihingte tungah ahi tu bangin nungta tahen a, nasepna taw a nuntak natu thalaw tahen, ci in kidop natu thu ka pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang suapuite awng, a pha sepna sia cimtak peuma heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi laithak sungah kong son uh thute a zui ngawl tu khat po om tha tu hi. Tuabang ahile, ama sia ciamtee tavun a, na koithong lel vun, tua hile, ama a maizum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang ama na ngal vawt heak vun; tua hi ngawl zaw in, suapui khat bangin a kidop thei natu na hil vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eite thinnopna ii naak ahi Topa ama mama in, a tawntung le a nanam in, thinnopna hong pia tahen. Topa in note theampo taw hong omkhawm tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paul in kong paupui hi ci in lai kong thaak sia keima khut tatak taw ka at hi: Laithak ka at sim ka minthuna sia hisia ahi hi; lai ka atzia hi bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus thuthiamna in note theampo taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
